# Files the Docker build context must not include.
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/.vs/
**/.vscode/
**/.idea/
**/.git/
**/.gitignore
**/TestResults/
**/logs/
**/*.user
**/docker-compose*.yml
**/Dockerfile
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
# Deployment overlays live beside the stack definitions and are not build inputs.
**/docs/
**/*.md
!README.md
**/.config/dotnet-tools.json
